    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: RHD&amp;apos;s institutional capacity in road operation and management enhanced 
Indicator: One road research and training center in Dhaka and three road operation units for road safety, maintenance, and overloading control established along the corridor (2016 baseline: 0) 
Progress/Status: Procurement for construction of road research and training center under WP-14 is completed and contract was signed on 9 September 2021, and road operation unit for road safety maintenance, etc. under package WP-15. WP-15 contract was signed on 7 April 2022. As of December 2025, the physical progress of WP-14: 38.14%, WP-15:65.73% respectively. 
